Bind Npc 29014 Zone 71 for karus
Bind Npc 29027 Zone 71 for elmorad
Quest 737 "[Lemegeton] Entrance of Hell"
    Journal for karus "You must join the devil war with [Order of the Sorcery] Bros."
    Journal for elmorad "You must join the devil war with [Order of the Sorcery] Sais."
    Collect 1 of 900255000
    Collect 1 of 900256000

Requires (player level >= 73 and player is karus and quest 735 is completed) or (player level >= 73 and player is elmorad and quest 736 is completed)

Rewards
    Give 250000 experience
    Give 30000 coins

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "This is the beginning of a tough fight. Let's focus! Bros of [Order of the Sorcery] is looking for you. Let's give him a hand."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "This is the beginning of a tough fight. Let's focus! Sais of [Order of the Sorcery] is looking for you. Let's give him a hand."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "You are here. Your last work was great."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Please give me the seal Scroll that you will seal in your body, then, <selfname>.\n\nWe must give Bros of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [18Devil] Bathin and [42Devil] Vephar."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "You are here. Your last work was great."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Please give me the seal Scroll that you will seal in your body, then, <selfname>.\n\nWe must give Sais of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [18Devil] Bathin and [42Devil] Vephar."

On in_progress
    Say "Where is the seal Scroll?"

On claimable
    Show quest "Thank you. With this seal Scroll, the soul of devil will be locked in this ring."

On completed
    Say "Phew. The atmosphere in the battlefield isn't changing. We're facing continuous difficulties. We must seal rest of the devils without a moment's delay. However, you have to stay alert because your next target is [Devil 30] Forneus, who swallows his enemy with the features of a great sea monster. He's very strong and thus has been granted the title of Marquis. Additionally, please seal [Devil 54] Murmur and [Devil 69] Decarabia together."
